# Plugin build output
Plugins/**/Binaries/
Plugins/**/Intermediate/

# Keep these files inside Build/ (icons, store configs, platform settings)
!Build/**/*.ico
!Build/**/*.icns
!Build/**/*.png
!Build/**/*.xml
!Build/**/*.plist
!Build/**/*.ini
!Build/**/*.txt
!Build/Android/
!Build/IOS/

